# Diagnostic: the Cards category of the Item page sent to the equip page. Jian gets the Quetzalcoatl card
# (given through the bag so its points are set) and the Sasquatch card; X, Items, Cards (bottom row, second),
# A, then shots and an A on the first card. Logs the state, Jian's slots 4 to 6, and the card counts.
include boot_from_save
wait 100
poke u8 0x0213BA1B 1
poke u8 0x0213BA29 1
watch u32 0x020B0010 state
watch u16 0x020B46A0 jian_slot4
watch u16 0x020B46A2 jian_slot5
watch u16 0x020B46A4 jian_slot6
press X 3
wait 80
press Down 8
wait 20
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
press Right 8
wait 30
shot ce_00
press A 8
wait 60
shot ce_01
press Right 8
wait 30
shot ce_02
press A 8
wait 60
shot ce_03
press A 8
wait 60
shot ce_04
